Subject: [PATCH 3/3] api: add /v1/ns/unregister

Unregisters (or, with "erase", erases) an account with the semantics of
NS UNREGISTER / NS ERASE: its clients are disconnected and the channels it
founded are unregistered. Lets an external account system drop deleted
accounts.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
